  revision 2014-10-20 {
    description "1.'.'as illegal named character ,modify all node names involving 802.1p, specific as follows:

    -802.1p       convert to  -8021p   e.g. in-802.1p-value  convert to in-8021p-value;

    _802.1p-value convert to  value-8021p;

    _802.1p       convert to  pri-8021p;

    enum 802.1p   convert to  enum 8021p;

    2. WRED,police and car support unit selection, add new nodes as follow:

    Add typedef: qos-rate-unit-type,qos-bucket-unit-type,qos-threshold-unit-type

    Add unit selection nodes:

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/random-detect/precedences/precedence/min-threshold-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/random-detect/precedences/precedence/max-threshold-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/random-detect/precedences/precedence/min-threshold-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/random-detect/precedences/precedence/max-threshold-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/cir-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/cbs-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/pir-pbs/pir-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/pir-pbs/pbs-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/cir-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/cbs-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/pir-pbs/pir-unit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/*/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/pir-pbs/pbs-unit

    \"*\" means normal, car-action, phb-based, sub-interface-based, switch-fabric-based

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/cir-unit

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/pir-unit

    \"*\" means unicast, multicast, broadcast, unknown, localport, dscp, precedence, mpls-exp, inner-vlan,

    outer-vlan, multi-vlan, inner-8021p, outer-8021p, multi-8021p, qos-group, access-list

    3. Car supports the configuration of inner and outer MPLS-EXP:

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/conform-action/ca-mpls-exp/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/conform-action/ca-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/exceed-action/ea-mpls-exp/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/exceed-action/ea-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/violate-action/va-mpls-exp/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-map/police/violate-action/va-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/conform-action/ca-mpls-exp/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/conform-action/ca-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/exceed-action/ea-mpls-exp/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/exceed-action/ea-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/violate-action/va-mpls-exp/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/policy-map/car-action/policy-maps/policy-map/class-maps/class-default/police/violate-action/va-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/conform-action/ca-mpls-exp/set-exp-transmit/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/conform-action/ca-multi-exp/set-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/exceed-action/ea-mpls-exp/set-exp-transmit/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/exceed-action/ea-multi-exp/set-multi-exp-transmit

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/violate-action/va-mpls-exp/set-exp-transmit/mpls-label-type

    /configuration/qos/rate-limit/*s/*/violate-action/va-multi-exp/set-multi-exp-transmit

    \"*\" means unicast, multicast, broadcast, unknown, localport, dscp, precedence, mpls-exp, inner-vlan,

    outer-vlan, multi-vlan, inner-8021p, outer-8021p, multi-8021p, qos-group, access-list

    4. Modify the configuration of switch-fabrics:

    /configuration/qos/switch-fabrics/normals/normal

    /configuration/qos/switch-fabrics/subslots/subslot

    /configuration/qos/switch-fabrics/subslots/group1s/group1

    /configuration/qos/switch-fabrics/subslots/group2s/group2

    /configuration/qos/switch-fabrics/subslots/ports/port

    5. Modify the configuration of qos-dot1p, support cvlan-out, add new nodes as follow:

    /configuration/qos/qos-dot1p/cvlan-outs/cvlan-outs" ;
  }

